  "details": "Hello, I've seen many people who report this bug of their mic being choppy/cutting out/glitching, whether from the very moment they open vrchat or after a while, but this isn't the issue I'm talking about and I don't know if I have it myself since I have a different issue. \n\nThe issue I'm having is that the mic is too low it barely picks up anything in the first place (I'm not speaking quietly, and have tried a couple of mic inputs, everything works fine on other apps but not in vrchat), I have microphone activation threshold on 5% and microphone output on 100% yet no difference can be observed. I also tried clearing cache, data, and even reinstalling but nothing changed.\n\nI didn't see anyone talk about this issue so it is also possible that it is an issue on my end only.\n\nMy phone is Honor 200, Model ELI-NX9.\n\nI'm busy right now but I'll provide details whenever I can.",
